# Mobile styling audit allowlist
# One substring per line. Findings containing the substring are skipped.
# Use sparingly for known false positives — prefer fixing real issues.
# Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# IMPORTANT: This audit is MOBILE-ONLY. Do not change desktop styles to
# silence findings. Prefer @media (max-width: 768px) overrides, or allowlist
# intentional drag UX that is not a page-scroll conflict.
#
# See also: scripts/audit-mobile-styling.sh header "DESIGN INTENT"
#           .roo/rules/mobile-phone-styling.md §§11–12

# Author chips in metadata picker: whole-chip drag reorders authors (main author = first).
# Not a page-scroll conflict like Story Arc cards — intentional dense-form UX.
metadata-picker.component.html:369 — cdkDrag on scrollable host without cdkDragHandle

# Sidebar menu section reorder mode: entire section is the drag surface only while
# isReorderMode is on — deliberate, important chrome UX. Do not "fix" with handles.
app.menu.component.html:72 — cdkDrag on scrollable host without cdkDragHandle
